### 6. Cache Stampede on Error (HIGH)

**Lines:** 73-77

When loader fails:
```
Goroutine A: loading, fails, deletes entry
Goroutine B: sees no entry, starts loading
Goroutine C: sees no entry, starts loading
... database hammered by N concurrent loads
```

No signaling to waiters that load failed!

**Severity:** HIGH - Your "cache stampede" issue.

