## Key Fixes Summary

| Bug | Fix |
|-----|-----|
| Concurrent map writes | `sync.RWMutex` on ALL map access |
| Stats corruption | `atomic.AddInt64` / `atomic.LoadInt64` |
| Cache stampede | Channel-based signaling, error caching |
| Stale reads | Read lock on fast path |
| GetMulti race | `sync.WaitGroup` + local mutex |
| waitForLoad race | Wait on channel, not polling |

*If we shadows have offended, think but this and all is mended! The code now dances in harmony, each goroutine waiting its proper turn. Up and down, up and down, I have led these bugs to ground!*
